
🔥 Set Operator কি?
👉 SQL-এ দুই বা ততোধিক SELECT statement এর result combine করার জন্য Set Operator ব্যবহার করা হয়
🔹 SQL Set Operators
UNION
UNION ALL
INTERSECT
EXCEPT (SQL Server এ থাকে)



🔥 1. UNION

👉 দুইটা result combine করে
👉 duplicate remove করে ✔

SELECT CustomerId FROM Orders
UNION
SELECT CustomerId FROM Customers;


📌 Result:

unique value only
🔥 2. UNION ALL

👉 সব data রাখে
👉 duplicate সহ ✔

SELECT CustomerId FROM Orders
UNION ALL
SELECT CustomerId FROM Customers;


📌 Result:

fast
duplicates allowed
🔥 3. INTERSECT

👉 দুইটা result এর common value দেয় ✔

SELECT CustomerId FROM Orders
INTERSECT
SELECT CustomerId FROM Customers;


📌 Result:

যেগুলো দুই table-এ আছে
🔥 4. EXCEPT

👉 প্রথম table এ আছে কিন্তু দ্বিতীয়তে নাই ❌

SELECT CustomerId FROM Customers
EXCEPT
SELECT CustomerId FROM Orders;


📌 Result:

only Customers without Orders
🔹 Important Rules ⚠️

✔ Same number of columns
✔ Same data type
✔ Column order must match
